# generated by matugen from the running wallpaper — loaded via kitty's
# globinclude. Only the chrome is themed: background/foreground, selection,
# cursor, borders and tabs. The ANSI color slots are deliberately NOT set —
# kitty's default palette stays, because Material-You roles are tone-80
# pastels that wash out as terminal colors (the legacy config ran plain
# kitty defaults too). Colors follow the scheme-fidelity palette picked in
# modules/home/theming/palette.nix.
